Layout matches upstream:
  include/   public headers
  src/       library .cpp files
  common/    bundled third-party (httplib.h, nlohmann json.hpp, base64.hpp)

To upgrade: pull a new tarball/clone from upstream and replace files in
include/, src/, common/ in place. Update the commit hash above. Re-apply
the local patches below.

Local patches:
  - src/mcp_server.cpp close_session: replaced unique_ptr::release() on
    the SSE worker thread with detach(). Upstream leaks the std::thread
    heap object and the underlying pthread (~512 KB stack on macOS)
    every time a /sse session closes.
